337
00:16:11.036 --> 00:16:12.938
Bedrock Knowledge Base for intelligent

338
00:16:13.205 --> 00:16:15.207
document retrieval, Visual Grounding,

339
00:16:15.207 --> 00:16:19.912
traceable answers with exact page locations and highlighted images,

